Page: 4
Section: 3.1.2 U2M
Text: 3.1.2 U2M We build an undirected User-to-Mentioned-User (U2M) graph, where the nodes are users, and there is an edge (u, v) between two nodes if user u men- tions user v in their tweets (i.e., u has authored a tweet that contains “@v” ). We run node2vec on this graph and we extract the embeddings for the users. As we are interested only in the troll users, we ignore the embeddings of users who are only mentioned by other trolls.

